## Supplier endpoints
@baseurl = localhost:8080/api/v1/suppliers

### Get all suppliers
GET {{baseurl}}?page=0&size=1
Content-Type: application/json


### Get supplier by id
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/suppliers/1


### Get Supplier by name
GET localhost:8080/api/v1/suppliers/search?name=soufiane


### Create new supplier
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "soufiane",
  "email": "soufian@gmail.com",
  "phone": "+212520654321",
  "rating": 4.8,
  "leadTime": 5
}


### update supplier
# Note: Endpoint not found in controller, assuming PUT /api/v1/suppliers/{id}
PUT localhost:8080/api/v1/suppliers/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Supplier Name"
}


### delete supplier
# Note: Endpoint not found in controller, but method exists. Assuming DELETE /api/v1/suppliers/{id}
DELETE localhost:8080/api/v1/suppliers/1